{:strongs 4116, :hebrew "מהרו", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to be liquid or flow easily, i.e. (by implication); to hurry (in a good or a bad sense); often used (with another verb) adverbially, promptly", :text "本义为液态或易于流动，即（引申义）；急忙（褒义或贬义均可）；常（与另一动词连用）作副词，迅速地。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:06:45.233371873Z"}